{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfea Shop Management</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manually stock shelves, set competitive prices, and customize your store layout to attract more customers and maximize profits. Build your dream retail empire from the ground up.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/0473b1d12024dbbebaa4960f68f325b4.poster.avif?t=1752603081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/0473b1d12024dbbebaa4960f68f325b4.webm?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/0473b1d12024dbbebaa4960f68f325b4.mp4?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/8be6f14c2d105b0d3207699977fe17ca.poster.avif?t=1752603081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/8be6f14c2d105b0d3207699977fe17ca.webm?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/8be6f14c2d105b0d3207699977fe17ca.mp4?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude9a Open World Logistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the city by foot or vehicle. Visit suppliers across the city, negotiate deals, and transport goods back to your store. Every delivery counts!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/c16be5b2476ac7df8c2d6524ec9cd1f3.poster.avif?t=1752603081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/c16be5b2476ac7df8c2d6524ec9cd1f3.webm?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/c16be5b2476ac7df8c2d6524ec9cd1f3.mp4?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcdc Licenses &amp; Permits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock business licenses to sell advanced weapons and rare items. Expand your legal inventory and take your shop to the next level.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/d616fb89d07c60411096649c47812ef8.poster.avif?t=1752603081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/d616fb89d07c60411096649c47812ef8.webm?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/d616fb89d07c60411096649c47812ef8.mp4?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udcc5 Weekly Economy System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your finances like a real entrepreneur. Pay utility bills, track expenses, and make strategic decisions to keep your business afloat in a shifting economy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/7ab2e17267b9d541c58cd108e1d79b03.poster.avif?t=1752603081\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/7ab2e17267b9d541c58cd108e1d79b03.webm?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838440/extras/7ab2e17267b9d541c58cd108e1d79b03.mp4?t=1752603081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud8